#: ../../docs/cost/ids/index.md:1
msgid "CoST IDS to OC4IDS mapping"
msgstr "Mapeo del CoST IDS al OC4IDS"

#: ../../docs/cost/ids/index.md:3
msgid "This section contains mappings from the CoST IDS to OC4IDS:"
msgstr "Esta sección contiene el mapeo del CoST IDS al OC4IDS"

#: ../../docs/cost/ids/index.md:5
msgid ""
"The [core standard mapping](core) describes a mapping of the proactive and "
"reactive disclosure elements of the \"core\" CoST IDS."
msgstr ""
"El [core standard mapping](core) describe un mapeo de los elementos para "
"divulgación proactiva y reactiva del \"núcleo\" del CoST IDS."

#: ../../docs/cost/ids/index.md:6
msgid ""
"The [sustainability modules mapping](sustainability) describes a mapping of "
"the optional CoST IDS sustainability modules."
msgstr ""
"El [sustainability modules mapping](sustainability) describe un mapeo a los "
"módulos opcionales de sostenibilidad del CoST IDS. "
